                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Movement option is terrible and gunplay is awkward. This is a straight PSVR port and it shows, which is unfortunate because the game has a great presentation. It's very intimidating when you get shouted at by life like guards in VR. I would honestly prefer this experience without the awful moving and shooting if it just had a theater like mode were you just watch everything happen around you, without the immersion getting ruined by the movement and shooting. I couldn't even finish it because I got too tired of the frequent cover shooting. This experience is only worth it for $5 or less.",
